{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SStwKaGUvuy9226VgrSbRw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: median\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Median档叙事核心转变：Claim1从\"CLS>CWM\"降级为\"CLS works where CWM fails\"。\n3\t  Function-level 4B null result (0pp gap, p=0.72) + 8B 2.43pp modest gap被接受但不视为exciting。\n4\t  Repo-level CLS可用(82-85% accuracy)但CWM catastrophically fail(50-93% unparseable)，\n5\t  部分reviewer质疑CWM failure是implementation问题(max_new_tokens设置、output format设计) 而非formulation固有限制，要求honest\n6\t  discussion。 重心转向Claim2+3：per-test equivalence(TOST p=0.007, ±2pp)作为methodological\n7\t  contribution， oracle characterization(T≥2 advantage集中在31.3% instances)作为practical\n8\t  decision framework。 DeepSeek结果mixed——function-level gap方向不一致(CWM在DeepSeek上可能略优)，\n9\t  repo-level CLS可用但无new insight。 Error complementarity(oracle ensemble 90.63%)成为supplementary\n10\t  selling point。 仍可投EMNLP main但需strengthened related work、honest CWM limitations section。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: CWM Generation Baseline (4B Function-Level)\n15\t  plan_id: cwm-baseline\n16\t  description: Qwen3-4B LoRA CWM vs CLS on function-level data, seed42\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    cls_accuracy: 87.51\n19\t    cls_pass_f1: 87.1\n20\t    cls_fail_f1: 87.9\n21\t    cwm_accuracy: 87.51\n22\t    cwm_pass_f1: 87.31\n23\t    cwm_fail_f1: 87.71\n24\t    accuracy_gap_pp: 0.0\n25\t    cwm_exact_match_rate: 84.02\n26\t    cwm_unparseable: 0\n27\t  result_rationale: 'Function-level execution output短(通常<50 tokens)，CWM不触发token-budget\n28\t    exhaustion 或string-value prediction failure modes。4B模型容量足以精确预测短输出。 两种formulation在此complexity\n29\t    level达到identical accuracy(87.51%)。 Exact match rate 84.02% < accuracy 87.51%说明CWM有部分output不完全匹配但\n30\t    通过pass/fail判断逻辑仍然correct——这预示repo-level上output matching会更困难。 Unparseable=0因为function-level输出格式统一简单。\n31\t    Median tier下此null result是叙事基础：排除\"CLS trivially easier\"的concern， 建立complexity-dependent\n32\t    advantage的前提。\n33\t\n34\t    '\n35\t  tables:\n36\t  - name: 'Table: Function-Level 4B CLS vs CWM (seed42)'\n37\t    columns:\n38\t    - Formulation\n39\t    - Accuracy\n40\t    - Pass F1\n41\t    - Fail F1\n42\t    - Exact Match\n43\t    - Unparseable%\n44\t    rows:\n45\t    - - CLS\n46\t      - 87.51\n47\t      - 87.1\n48\t      - 87.9\n49\t      - N/A\n50\t      - 0\n51\t    - - CWM\n52\t      - 87.51\n53\t      - 87.31\n54\t      - 87.71\n55\t      - 84.02\n56\t      - 0\n57\t    - - Δ (CLS−CWM)\n58\t      - 0.0\n59\t      - −0.21\n60\t      - 0.19\n61\t      - —\n62\t      - 0\n63\t  figures_description:\n64\t  - Per-class F1 bar chart, CLS与CWM几乎完全重叠\n65\t  analysis: 'Null result confirmed. CWM exact_match (84.02%) < accuracy (87.51%)的gap(3.49pp)\n66\t    暗示CWM在部分case上output不精确匹配但仍被判为correct—— repo-level上这个gap会急剧扩大导致catastrophic failure。\n67\t\n68\t    '\n69\t- name: Multi-Seed Core Validation (5-seed, 4B)\n70\t  plan_id: multi-seed-core\n71\t  description: CLS 5-seed {42,123,456,789,0} + CWM 5-seed统计\n72\t  expected_results:\n73\t    cls_seeds:\n74\t      s42:\n75\t        accuracy: 87.83\n76\t        pass_f1: 88.06\n77\t        fail_f1: 87.59\n78\t      s123:\n79\t        accuracy: 89.52\n80\t        pass_f1: 89.64\n81\t        fail_f1: 89.4\n82\t      s456:\n83\t        accuracy: 87.88\n84\t        pass_f1: 87.53\n85\t        fail_f1: 88.21\n86\t      s789:\n87\t        accuracy: 89.0\n88\t        pass_f1: 88.9\n89\t        fail_f1: 89.1\n90\t      s0:\n91\t        accuracy: 87.94\n92\t        pass_f1: 87.79\n93\t        fail_f1: 88.08\n94\t    cls_mean_accuracy: 88.43\n95\t    cls_std_accuracy: 0.76\n96\t    cwm_seeds:\n97\t      s42:\n98\t        accuracy: 87.51\n99\t        pass_f1: 87.31\n100\t        fail_f1: 87.71\n101\t      s123:\n102\t        accuracy: 87.2\n103\t        pass_f1: 86.95\n104\t        fail_f1: 87.44\n105\t      s456:\n106\t        accuracy: 86.98\n107\t        pass_f1: 86.66\n108\t        fail_f1: 87.29\n109\t      s789:\n110\t        accuracy: 86.67\n111\t        pass_f1: 86.74\n112\t        fail_f1: 86.6\n113\t      s0:\n114\t        accuracy: 87.57\n115\t        pass_f1: 87.18\n116\t        fail_f1: 87.93\n117\t    cwm_mean_accuracy: 87.19\n118\t    cwm_std_accuracy: 0.36\n119\t    mean_gap_pp: 1.24\n120\t    paired_t_p: ~0.06\n121\t    significant_at_005: false\n122\t  result_rationale: 'CLS 5-seed mean 88.43 vs CWM 87.19, gap 1.24pp。Paired t-test\n123\t    p≈0.06，α=0.05下不显著。 CLS variance (std 0.76) > CWM (std 0.36)：CLS对LoRA初始化更敏感，因为binary\n124\t    classification 的decision boundary位置对seed更敏感；CWM的generation target更deterministic，\n125\t    不同seed主要影响generation fluency而非correctness。 Seed123是CLS的outlier high(89.52)和CWM的near-mean(87.20)，贡献了最大pair\n126\t    gap。 Median tier：trend存在但不conclusive，这是4B function-level的inherent limitation——\n127\t    task太简单，两种formulation的capacity均已饱和。\n128\t\n129\t    '\n130\t  tables:\n131\t  - name: 'Table: 4B 5-Seed CLS vs CWM'\n132\t    columns:\n133\t    - Seed\n134\t    - CLS Acc\n135\t    - CWM Acc\n136\t    - Gap (pp)\n137\t    rows:\n138\t    - - 42\n139\t      - 87.83\n140\t      - 87.51\n141\t      - 0.32\n142\t    - - 123\n143\t      - 89.52\n144\t      - 87.2\n145\t      - 2.32\n146\t    - - 456\n147\t      - 87.88\n148\t      - 86.98\n149\t      - 0.9\n150\t    - - 789\n151\t      - 89.0\n152\t      - 86.67\n153\t      - 2.33\n154\t    - - 0\n155\t      - 87.94\n156\t      - 87.57\n157\t      - 0.37\n158\t    - - Mean±Std\n159\t      - 88.43±0.76\n160\t      - 87.19±0.36\n161\t      - '+1.24'\n162\t  figures_description:\n163\t  - 5-seed accuracy dot plot with mean ± std bars, CLS蓝色、CWM橙色\n164\t  analysis: 'p≈0.06处于borderline。Paper报告为\"directional trend (p=0.06) at 4B,  becomes\n165\t    significant at 8B\"，building scaling narrative。\n166\t\n167\t    '\n168\t- name: Trace-then-Judge Ablation\n169\t  plan_id: trace-then-judge\n170\t  description: 'Chain-of-thought style: generate reasoning trace → pass/fail'\n171\t  expected_results:\n172\t    training_status: failed\n173\t    reason: output format instability, training diverged\n174\t  result_rationale: '4B LoRA同时学习生成reasoning trace和predict pass/fail，两个objective竞争有限capacity。\n175\t    Trace format不稳定导致pass/fail token被reasoning token侵蚀，accuracy崩溃。 这不是fundamental\n176\t    impossibility而是engineering/capacity问题——更大模型或更精细的 format control可能解决。Median tier下dropped\n177\t    from paper，brief mention in limitations。\n178\t\n179\t    '\n180\t  tables: []\n181\t  figures_description: []\n182\t  analysis: '不影响core claims。如果成功，它会ablate away\"CLS优势来自skipping reasoning\"的concern；\n183\t    failure意味着这个concern无法directly addressed，但8B scaling evidence间接addresses。\n184\t\n185\t    '\n186\t- name: Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\n187\t  plan_id: traj-level-finetuned\n188\t  description: 4B LoRA trained on resolved/unresolved prediction (5-seed)\n189\t  expected_results:\n190\t    seed42:\n191\t      accuracy: 85.66\n192\t      unresolved_f1: 87.5\n193\t      resolved_f1: 83.18\n194\t      consistency: 79.94\n195\t    seed123:\n196\t      accuracy: 85.47\n197\t      unresolved_f1: 87.0\n198\t      resolved_f1: 83.52\n199\t      consistency: 78.59\n200\t    seed456:\n201\t      accuracy: 87.4\n202\t      unresolved_f1: 88.7\n203\t      resolved_f1: 85.8\n204\t      consistency: 78.8\n205\t    seed789:\n206\t      accuracy: 87.31\n207\t      unresolved_f1: 88.27\n208\t      resolved_f1: 86.17\n209\t      consistency: 76.74\n210\t    seed0:\n211\t      accuracy: 85.66\n212\t      unresolved_f1: 87.37\n213\t      resolved_f1: 83.41\n214\t      consistency: 79.55\n215\t    mean_accuracy: 86.3\n216\t    std_accuracy: 0.93\n217\t  result_rationale: 'Trajectory-level mean accuracy 86.30% vs per-test CLS 88.43%，gap\n218\t    2.13pp。 这个gap的主要来源：(1) trajectory-level每个problem只产生1个训练样本 vs per-test产生T个， effective\n219\t    training data量更少；(2) resolved需要ALL tests pass——这种conjunctive logic 比per-test的individual判断更难学。Consistency\n220\t    rate ~78%说明同一problem内per-test predictions 有~22%不一致，暗示model在同一problem内对不同tests的判断受shared\n221\t    context bias影响。 Median tier下此gap supports Claim 2的\"per-test不损失accuracy\"叙事，但gap部分\n222\t    来自training data confound，需honest报告。\n223\t\n224\t    '\n225\t  tables:\n226\t  - name: 'Table: Trajectory-Level 5-Seed Results'\n227\t    columns:\n228\t    - Seed\n229\t    - Accuracy\n230\t    - Resolved F1\n231\t    - Unresolved F1\n232\t    - Consistency%\n233\t    rows:\n234\t    - - 42\n235\t      - 85.66\n236\t      - 83.18\n237\t      - 87.5\n238\t      - 79.94\n239\t    - - 123\n240\t      - 85.47\n241\t      - 83.52\n242\t      - 87.0\n243\t      - 78.59\n244\t    - - 456\n245\t      - 87.4\n246\t      - 85.8\n247\t      - 88.7\n248\t      - 78.8\n249\t    - - 789\n250\t      - 87.31\n251\t      - 86.17\n252\t      - 88.27\n253\t      - 76.74\n254\t    - - 0\n255\t      - 85.66\n256\t      - 83.41\n257\t      - 87.37\n258\t      - 79.55\n259\t    - - Mean±Std\n260\t      - 86.30±0.93\n261\t      - 84.42±1.36\n262\t      - 87.77±0.68\n263\t      - 78.72±1.25\n264\t  figures_description: []\n265\t  analysis: 'Per-test ≥ trajectory at variant-level，TOST equivalence test (下述) 更rigorously\n266\t    quantifies。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t- name: Model Size Scaling (8B, 3-seed)\n270\t  plan_id: model-size-scaling\n271\t  description: CLS vs CWM at 8B scale, seeds {42, 123, 456}\n272\t  expected_results:\n273\t    cls8b_seeds:\n274\t      s42:\n275\t        accuracy: 90.48\n276\t        pass_f1: 90.86\n277\t        fail_f1: 90.06\n278\t      s123:\n279\t        accuracy: 89.4\n280\t        pass_f1: 89.54\n281\t        fail_f1: 89.19\n282\t      s456:\n283\t        accuracy: 88.31\n284\t        pass_f1: 88.2\n285\t        fail_f1: 88.41\n286\t    cls8b_mean_accuracy: 89.4\n287\t    cls8b_std: 1.09\n288\t    cwm8b_seeds:\n289\t      s42:\n290\t        accuracy: 87.67\n291\t        pass_f1: 87.57\n292\t        fail_f1: 87.77\n293\t      s123:\n294\t        accuracy: 86.98\n295\t        pass_f1: 86.83\n296\t        fail_f1: 87.13\n297\t      s456:\n298\t        accuracy: 86.24\n299\t        pass_f1: 85.96\n300\t        fail_f1: 86.51\n301\t    cwm8b_mean_accuracy: 86.96\n302\t    cwm8b_std: 0.72\n303\t    mean_gap_pp: 2.43\n304\t    per_seed_gaps:\n305\t      s42: 2.81\n306\t      s123: 2.42\n307\t      s456: 2.07\n308\t    cls_4b_to_8b_gain_pp: 0.97\n309\t    cwm_4b_to_8b_gain_pp: -0.23\n310\t  result_rationale: '8B CLS (89.40) vs CWM (86.96) gap扩大到2.43pp，所有3个seed方向一致(2.07-2.81pp)。\n311\t    关键asymmetry：CLS从4B→8B提升0.97pp但CWM下降0.23pp。 CWM在8B未获益的原因：function-level generation的bottleneck在exact\n312\t    string matching， 不是semantic understanding。额外的8B capacity没有reduce string matching\n313\t    error—— 模型更好地\"理解\"了代码但仍然在output format上犯同样的errors。 CLS则从extra capacity中获益：binary\n314\t    classification的decision boundary在高维space中 变得更smooth，reducing borderline case errors。\n315\t    Median tier：2.43pp被接受为real but modest。Reviewer说\"interesting but not dramatic\"。\n316\t    结合repo-level的catastrophic CWM failure讲故事：function-level hints at差异， repo-level放大为qualitative\n317\t    failure。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t  tables:\n321\t  - name: 'Table: 8B 3-Seed Scaling'\n322\t    columns:\n323\t    - Size\n324\t    - CLS Mean Acc\n325\t    - CWM Mean Acc\n326\t    - Gap (pp)\n327\t    rows:\n328\t    - - 4B (5-seed)\n329\t      - 88.43\n330\t      - 87.19\n331\t      - 1.24\n332\t    - - 8B (seed42)\n333\t      - 90.48\n334\t      - 87.67\n335\t      - 2.81\n336\t    - - 8B (seed123)\n337\t      - 89.4\n338\t      - 86.98\n339\t      - 2.42\n340\t    - - 8B (seed456)\n341\t      - 88.31\n342\t      - 86.24\n343\t      - 2.07\n344\t    - - 8B (3-seed mean)\n345\t      - 89.4\n346\t      - 86.96\n347\t      - 2.43\n348\t  figures_description:\n349\t  - 'Scaling plot: x=model size, y=accuracy, CLS和CWM两条线, 8B处diverge'\n350\t  - Per-seed gap bar chart, 3 bars all positive (2.07-2.81)\n351\t  analysis: '8B gap consistent across seeds is the function-level strongest evidence\n352\t    for Claim 1。 但2.43pp在absolute terms仍modest。Paper frame为\"scaling direction\"而非\"large\n353\t    effect\"。\n354\t\n355\t    '\n356\t- name: Diagnostic Re-Repair (Downstream Proof-of-Concept)\n357\t  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n358\t  description: Per-test failure predictions用于guide SWE-agent re-repair on 200 instances\n359\t  expected_results:\n360\t    n_instances_evaluated: 120\n361\t    baseline_resolve_rate_pct: 24.2\n362\t    with_pertest_resolve_rate_pct: 28.3\n363\t    improvement_pp: 4.1\n364\t    p_value_mcnemar: 0.11\n365\t    significant_at_005: false\n366\t    instances_diagnostic_helped: 14\n367\t    instances_diagnostic_hurt: 9\n368\t    net_helped: 5\n369\t    avg_repair_attempts_baseline: 3.2\n370\t    avg_repair_attempts_diagnostic: 2.8\n371\t  result_rationale: 'Median tier下re-repair受三重限制：(1) 资源不足仅完成120/200 instances； (2)\n372\t    per-test verifier error rate ~12.5%意味着约1/8的diagnostic信号是错误的， misleading repair\n373\t    agent在错误方向搜索；(3) SWE-bench instances 68.7% T=1， 这些case per-test info退化为trajectory-level，不提供额外guidance。\n374\t    4.1pp improvement方向正确，repair attempts减少(3.2→2.8)说明diagnostic确实 narrow了search space。但p=0.11在120\n375\t    samples下不显著(power analysis显示需~400 instances)。 Net helped仅5(14-9)，说明diagnostic\n376\t    precision不够——错误诊断导致9个case regression。 Median tier将此relegated to appendix/future\n377\t    work，不作为main claim。\n378\t\n379\t    '\n380\t  tables:\n381\t  - name: 'Table (Appendix): Re-Repair Pilot Results'\n382\t    columns:\n383\t    - Condition\n384\t    - Resolve Rate\n385\t    - Avg Attempts\n386\t    - N\n387\t    rows:\n388\t    - - Baseline (no per-test)\n389\t      - 24.2%\n390\t      - 3.2\n391\t      - 120\n392\t    - - With per-test diagnostic\n393\t      - 28.3%\n394\t      - 2.8\n395\t      - 120\n396\t    - - Δ\n397\t      - +4.1pp (p=0.11)\n398\t      - −0.4\n399\t      - ''\n400\t  figures_description:\n401\t  - 'Paired comparison: helped(14) vs hurt(9) vs neutral(97) breakdown'\n402\t  analysis: 'Directional but non-significant。Paper frame: \"preliminary evidence for\n403\t    diagnostic utility, limited by verifier accuracy and sample size; full evaluation\n404\t    left to future work.\"\n405\t\n406\t    '\n407\t- name: Per-Test Precision/Recall Analysis\n408\t  plan_id: per-test-precision-recall\n409\t  description: Per-test failure prediction quality on full function-level test set\n410\t  expected_results:\n411\t    accuracy: 87.51\n412\t    fail_precision: 82.75\n413\t    fail_recall: 93.64\n414\t    fail_f1: 87.86\n415\t    pass_precision: 93.24\n416\t    pass_recall: 81.8\n417\t    pass_f1: 87.15\n418\t    FP_count: 58\n419\t    FN_count: 178\n420\t    FP_FN_ratio: 0.326\n421\t    best_mutation: return_value (97.26%)\n422\t    worst_mutation: off_by_one (82.56%)\n423\t    bucket_6_10_acc: 96.3\n424\t    bucket_11plus_acc: 87.12\n425\t  result_rationale: '模型显著biased toward predicting fail：fail_recall(93.64%) >> pass_recall(81.80%)。\n426\t    这是因为training data中mutation几乎都导致fail，模型学到了conservative prior。 FP:FN = 58:178 →\n427\t    75.4% of errors are false negatives(miss actual fails)。 这quantifies CLS的characteristic\n428\t    failure mode：\"miss bugs\"而非\"false alarms\"。 Mutation类型分析：return_value最容易(97.26%)因为return值变化导致output大幅改变；\n429\t    off_by_one最难(82.56%)因为边界条件变化subtle，模型需要precise numerical reasoning。 Bucket analysis：6-10\n430\t    tests的problems accuracy最高(96.3%)因为multiple tests 提供redundant signal；11+ tests降至87.12%因为input\n431\t    length增加导致attention稀释。\n432\t\n433\t    '\n434\t  tables:\n435\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Test Diagnostic Quality'\n436\t    columns:\n437\t    - Class\n438\t    - Precision\n439\t    - Recall\n440\t    - F1\n441\t    rows:\n442\t    - - Fail (bug detected)\n443\t      - 82.75\n444\t      - 93.64\n445\t      - 87.86\n446\t    - - Pass (correct code)\n447\t      - 93.24\n448\t      - 81.8\n449\t      - 87.15\n450\t  - name: 'Table: Accuracy by Mutation Type'\n451\t    columns:\n452\t    - Mutation\n453\t    - Accuracy\n454\t    rows:\n455\t    - - return_value\n456\t      - 97.26%\n457\t    - - variable_swap\n458\t      - ~94%\n459\t    - - operator_swap\n460\t      - ~88%\n461\t    - - off_by_one\n462\t      - 82.56%\n463\t  figures_description:\n464\t  - Confusion matrix heatmap\n465\t  - Accuracy by mutation type + test count bucket grouped bar chart\n466\t  analysis: 'Error asymmetry (75% FN) 对downstream re-repair的影响：diagnostic signal会\n467\t    under-report failures，导致repair agent可能miss真正的bug。 这与CWM的complementary failure\n468\t    mode(83% false alarms)形成对比，支持oracle ensemble叙事。\n469\t\n470\t    '\n471\t- name: Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\n472\t  plan_id: oracle-f2p-stratified\n473\t  description: Per-test advantage breakdown by FAIL_TO_PASS test count\n474\t  expected_results:\n475\t    T1_pct: 68.7\n476\t    T1_block_adv: -0.09\n477\t    T2_pct: 19.1\n478\t    T2_block_adv: 31.69\n479\t    T3_5_pct: 7.1\n480\t    T3_5_block_adv: 40.74\n481\t    T6plus_pct: 5.1\n482\t    T6plus_block_adv: 40.06\n483\t    overall_block_adv: 10.93\n484\t    T2_contribution_pct: 55.3\n485\t  result_rationale: 'T=1时per-test ≡ trajectory-level（只有一个fail test），advantage仅来自prediction\n486\t    accuracy 微小差异（-0.09pp，essentially zero）。T=2时per-test advantage跳到31.69pp(block\n487\t    model)： 原因是trajectory-level把两个tests的pass/fail合并为一个binary判断，丢失了which test failed的信息；\n488\t    per-test分别预测，在一个test correct另一个wrong时仍能partial credit。 T≥3的advantage plateau在~40pp因为边际tests的marginal\n489\t    information增量递减。 T2贡献55.3%的overall advantage因为它是最大的multi-test bucket(19.1%)且advantage显著。\n490\t    Key insight for median tier：SWE-bench Verified 68.7%是T=1，限制了per-test的 population-level\n491\t    impact。但targeting T≥2 subset (31.3%)时per-test显著优于trajectory。\n492\t\n493\t    '\n494\t  tables:\n495\t  - name: 'Table: Oracle Per-Test Advantage by F2P Count'\n496\t    columns:\n497\t    - T\n498\t    - '% Instances'\n499\t    - Block Adv (pp)\n500\t    - Contribution to Overall\n501\t    rows:\n502\t    - - T=1\n503\t      - 68.7\n504\t      - -0.09\n505\t      - −0.6%\n506\t    - - T=2\n507\t      - 19.1\n508\t      - 31.69\n509\t      - 55.3%\n510\t    - - T=3−5\n511\t      - 7.1\n512\t      - 40.74\n513\t      - 26.4%\n514\t    - - T≥6\n515\t      - 5.1\n516\t      - 40.06\n517\t      - 18.7%\n518\t    - - Overall\n519\t      - 100\n520\t      - 10.93\n521\t      - 100%\n522\t  figures_description:\n523\t  - 'Stacked bar: per-test advantage by T bucket with instance % overlay'\n524\t  - SWE-bench F2P count distribution histogram\n525\t  analysis: 'Claim 3的primary evidence。Actionable finding：deploy per-test only when\n526\t    T≥2。 This characterization is the paper''s strongest unique contribution in median\n527\t    tier。\n528\t\n529\t    '\n530\t- name: Oracle Total (F2P+P2P) Validation\n531\t  plan_id: oracle-total-validated\n532\t  description: When P2P regression detection adds value vs hurts\n533\t  expected_results:\n534\t    total_reg5pct:\n535\t      iid_adv: -0.01\n536\t      block_adv: -0.005\n537\t      beneficial: false\n538\t    total_reg10pct:\n539\t      iid_adv: 0.132\n540\t      block_adv: 0.083\n541\t      beneficial: true\n542\t    total_reg20pct:\n543\t      iid_adv: 0.357\n544\t      block_adv: 0.278\n545\t      beneficial: true\n546\t    empirical_p2p_regression_rate: ~0.01\n547\t  result_rationale: 'Empirical P2P regression rate仅~1%，远低于10%的breakeven threshold。\n548\t    5% regression下per-test P2P monitoring实际HURTS(-0.01pp)：false positive P2P predictions\n549\t    导致correct patches被wrongly rejected。只有当regression rate≥10%时， true positive detection才outweigh\n550\t    false positive cost。 这是negative但highly informative finding。当前SWE-bench patch质量高，\n551\t    几乎不break passing tests——但real-world场景中regression rate可能更高。\n552\t\n553\t    '\n554\t  tables:\n555\t  - name: 'Table: P2P Regression Threshold'\n556\t    columns:\n557\t    - Regression Rate\n558\t    - Per-Test Adv (IID)\n559\t    - Beneficial?\n560\t    rows:\n561\t    - - 1% (empirical)\n562\t      - ≈0\n563\t      - 'No'\n564\t    - - 5%\n565\t      - -0.01\n566\t      - 'No'\n567\t    - - 10%\n568\t      - 0.132\n569\t      - 'Yes'\n570\t    - - 20%\n571\t      - 0.357\n572\t      - 'Yes'\n573\t  figures_description:\n574\t  - Regression rate vs per-test advantage curve with breakeven point marked\n575\t  analysis: 'Honest negative finding。Strengthens paper credibility by showing nuanced\n576\t    analysis rather than overclaiming P2P utility。\n577\t\n578\t    '\n579\t- name: Block Correlation Empirical Validation\n580\t  plan_id: block-corr-empirical\n581\t  description: Measured ICC and design effect from trained model predictions\n582\t  expected_results:\n583\t    icc: 0.1909\n584\t    icc_p_value: 0.0\n585\t    design_effect: 3.9676\n586\t    all_correct_observed: 46\n587\t    all_correct_expected_iid: 16.35\n588\t    all_correct_ratio: 2.81\n589\t    error_std_observed: 0.1531\n590\t    error_std_expected_iid: 0.0811\n591\t    error_std_ratio: 1.89\n592\t    n_samples: 1890\n593\t    n_problems: 114\n594\t  result_rationale: 'ICC=0.191说明19.1%的prediction error variance is between-problem(problem-level\n595\t    effect)。 这显著高于iid的0%(p<0.001)但远低于full block correlation(ICC=1.0)。 Design effect\n596\t    3.97意味着effective sample size = nominal/3.97， justifies ±2pp TOST margin：在effective\n597\t    N更小时，2pp是practical equivalence。 All-correct ratio 2.81x：观测到46个全对problem vs iid预期16.35个。\n598\t    模型对某些problems consistently correct(可能这些code patterns简单)， 对另一些consistently wrong(可能涉及complex\n599\t    logic)——errors不是random per-test。 Median tier下ICC=0.19是moderate，supports block\n600\t    model但effect size温和。 Oracle analysis中的block curve是upper bound，iid curve是lower\n601\t    bound， reality在两者之间但closer to iid端。\n602\t\n603\t    '\n604\t  tables:\n605\t  - name: 'Table: Error Correlation Validation'\n606\t    columns:\n607\t    - Metric\n608\t    - Observed\n609\t    - IID Expected\n610\t    - Ratio\n611\t    rows:\n612\t    - - All-correct problems\n613\t      - 46\n614\t      - 16.35\n615\t      - 2.81×\n616\t    - - Error rate std\n617\t      - 0.153\n618\t      - 0.081\n619\t      - 1.89×\n620\t    - - ICC\n621\t      - 0.191\n622\t      - 0\n623\t      - —\n624\t    - - Design Effect\n625\t      - 3.97\n626\t      - 1.0\n627\t      - 3.97×\n628\t  figures_description:\n629\t  - 'Per-problem error rate distribution: observed vs IID-expected histogram overlay'\n630\t  analysis: 'Validates block correlation assumption partially. The realistic per-test\n631\t    advantage is between IID and block curves. Paper should present both bounds with\n632\t    empirical ICC as the arbitrator rather than claiming only the optimistic block\n633\t    estimate.\n634\t\n635\t    '\n636\t- name: SWE-bench PerTest Dataset Construction\n637\t  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n638\t  description: Docker re-evaluation of 500 SWE-bench Verified instances × 16 candidates\n639\t  expected_results:\n640\t    target_instances: 500\n641\t    successful_instances: 435\n642\t    failed_instances: 65\n643\t    success_rate_pct: 87.0\n644\t    total_candidate_evaluations: 6960\n645\t    total_pertest_labels: ~68000\n646\t    avg_tests_per_instance: 156\n647\t    avg_f2p_tests: 2.8\n648\t    avg_p2p_tests: 153\n649\t    p2p_regression_rate: 0.013\n650\t    avg_code_tokens: 2800\n651\t    construction_time_hours: 22\n652\t  result_rationale: '65/500 Docker failures(13%)主要因为legacy Python packages unavailable\n653\t    in 2026、 特定版本pinning broken、Docker image build timeouts for large repos。 435 instances足以support\n654\t    repo-level training(350 train/85 test split approx)。 F2P stats与SWE-bench metadata一致(median\n655\t    T=1, mean T=2.8)。 P2P regression rate ~1.3%再次confirms低regression率——P2P维度信号弱。 Code\n656\t    tokens ~2800远超function-level的~200，这是repo-level generalization challenge的根源： 模型必须在10x更长的input上做judgment，attention\n657\t    dilution显著。 Median tier下data collection是infrastructure contribution，paper brief\n658\t    mention， detailed stats in appendix。\n659\t\n660\t    '\n661\t  tables:\n662\t  - name: 'Table (Appendix): SWE-bench-PerTest Stats'\n663\t    columns:\n664\t    - Statistic\n665\t    - Value\n666\t    rows:\n667\t    - - Instances (successful)\n668\t      - 435\n669\t    - - Candidates/instance\n670\t      - 16\n671\t    - - Per-test labels\n672\t      - ~68K\n673\t    - - Avg F2P tests\n674\t      - 2.8\n675\t    - - Avg code tokens\n676\t      - 2800\n677\t    - - P2P regression rate\n678\t      - 1.3%\n679\t  figures_description:\n680\t  - Test count distribution (F2P vs P2P)\n681\t  analysis: 'Sufficient data for repo-level experiments. Docker failure rate acceptable.\n682\t    P2P regression rate confirms prior negative finding.\n683\t\n684\t    '\n685\t- name: Repo-Level Training (CLS + CWM, multi-attempt)\n686\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n687\t  description: Repo-level CLS at 4B/8B + CWM attempts, checkpoint sweeps\n688\t  expected_results:\n689\t    cls_4b_best:\n690\t      accuracy: 82.35\n691\t      f1_macro: 74.74\n692\t      fail_f1: 60.87\n693\t      pass_f1: 88.6\n694\t      fail_precision: 76.0\n695\t      fail_recall: 50.76\n696\t      unparseable_pct: 1.3\n697\t    cls_4b_seed123_test:\n698\t      accuracy: 75.33\n699\t      fail_f1: 50.5\n700\t    cls_8b_best:\n701\t      accuracy: 84.79\n702\t      f1_macro: 81.18\n703\t      fail_f1: 72.93\n704\t      pass_f1: 89.43\n705\t      unparseable_pct: 0\n706\t    cls_8b_seed123:\n707\t      accuracy: 85.6\n708\t      fail_f1: 65.89\n709\t    cls_8b_multiseed_mean_accuracy: 85.2\n710\t    cls_8b_multiseed_fail_f1_mean: 69.41\n711\t    cwm_v10:\n712\t      accuracy: 69.91\n713\t      unparseable_pct: 93.0\n714\t      fail_f1: 11.54\n715\t    cwm_v12:\n716\t      accuracy: 58.04\n717\t      unparseable_pct: 53.7\n718\t      fail_f1: 34.12\n719\t    cwm_seed123:\n720\t      accuracy: 59.09\n721\t      unparseable_pct: 67.2\n722\t    cwm_8b_attempts: all failed (training/eval infrastructure issues)\n723\t  result_rationale: 'Repo-level CLS在median range内：8B multi-seed mean ~85%在[80,85]上缘，\n724\t    fail_f1 ~69%在[60,72]内。Minority class(fail)预测弱的原因： repo-level code长(2800+ tokens)使模型难以精确定位failure\n725\t    cause， fail recall低(50-56%)说明模型对大量fail case预测为pass——conservative model under-diagnoses\n726\t    failures。Fail precision较好(76-92%)说明当模型predict fail时通常correct。\n727\t\n728\t    CWM catastrophic failure：93%(v10)或53.7%(v12)或67.2%(seed123) unparseable。 原因是repo-level\n729\t    execution output极长(tracebacks、assertion details、log messages)， generation model无法produce\n730\t    matching output。Max_new_tokens限制(64 in v10)导致 几乎所有output被truncated。即使放宽到1024 tokens(v11)，仍有75.2%\n731\t    unparseable。\n732\t\n733\t    Median tier核心tension：CWM failure是formulation limitation还是implementation issue？\n734\t    Reviewer会argue：(1) max_new_tokens太短是implementation choice；(2) better output format\n735\t    (structured JSON vs raw string)可能reduce unparseable。Paper需要honest discussion：\n736\t    \"even with generous token budget, CWM unparseable rate remains >50%, suggesting\n737\t    formulation-level difficulty in predicting complex execution outputs.\"\n738\t\n739\t    4B seed variance高(82.35 vs 75.33)是concern——对checkpoint selection敏感。 8B更稳定(84.79\n740\t    vs 85.60)因为更大model对hyperparameter less sensitive。\n741\t\n742\t    '\n743\t  tables:\n744\t  - name: 'Table: Repo-Level CLS vs CWM'\n745\t    columns:\n746\t    - Model\n747\t    - Formulation\n748\t    - Best Acc\n749\t    - Fail F1\n750\t    - Unparseable%\n751\t    rows:\n752\t    - - 4B\n753\t      - CLS (seed42)\n754\t      - 82.35\n755\t      - 60.87\n756\t      - 1.3\n757\t    - - 4B\n758\t      - CLS (seed123)\n759\t      - 75.33\n760\t      - 50.5\n761\t      - 0\n762\t    - - 8B\n763\t      - CLS (seed42)\n764\t      - 84.79\n765\t      - 72.93\n766\t      - 0\n767\t    - - 8B\n768\t      - CLS (seed123)\n769\t      - 85.6\n770\t      - 65.89\n771\t      - 0\n772\t    - - 4B\n773\t      - CWM (v10)\n774\t      - 69.91\n775\t      - 11.54\n776\t      - 93.0\n777\t    - - 4B\n778\t      - CWM (v12)\n779\t      - 58.04\n780\t      - 34.12\n781\t      - 53.7\n782\t    - - 4B\n783\t      - CWM (seed123)\n784\t      - 59.09\n785\t      - —\n786\t      - 67.2\n787\t  - name: 'Table: Complexity-Dependent Formulation Gap'\n788\t    columns:\n789\t    - Level\n790\t    - CLS Best Acc\n791\t    - CWM Best Acc\n792\t    - CWM Unparseable%\n793\t    rows:\n794\t    - - Function (4B)\n795\t      - 87.51\n796\t      - 87.51\n797\t      - 0\n798\t    - - Function (8B)\n799\t      - 90.48\n800\t      - 87.67\n801\t      - 0\n802\t    - - Repo (4B)\n803\t      - 82.35\n804\t      - 69.91\n805\t      - 93.0\n806\t    - - Repo (8B)\n807\t      - 84.79\n808\t      - failed\n809\t      - —\n810\t  figures_description:\n811\t  - CLS checkpoint accuracy curve (4B and 8B, test set)\n812\t  - CWM unparseable rate across 10+ training attempts timeline\n813\t  - Function vs Repo level CLS/CWM gap visualization\n814\t  analysis: 'Repo-level是paper最contentious evidence。Framing必须是\"CLS works where CWM\n815\t    fails\" 而非\"CLS beats CWM\"——因为CWM没有fair comparison point（它根本无法produce valid output）。\n816\t    Reviewer concern mitigation：show multiple CWM attempts with different configs，\n817\t    demonstrate that unparseable rate persists despite engineering effort。\n818\t\n819\t    '\n820\t- name: LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\n821\t  plan_id: llm-judge-baseline\n822\t  description: Qwen3-8B and 32B NF4 zero-shot judge baselines\n823\t  expected_results:\n824\t    judge_8b:\n825\t      accuracy: 64.4\n826\t      fail_f1: 72.2\n827\t      fail_recall: 95.8\n828\t      pass_recall: 35.1\n829\t      traj_accuracy: 99.1\n830\t    judge_32b:\n831\t      accuracy: 71.69\n832\t      fail_f1: 75.91\n833\t      fail_recall: 92.43\n834\t      pass_recall: 52.35\n835\t    finetuned_4b:\n836\t      accuracy: 87.51\n837\t    finetuned_vs_judge_32b_gap_pp: 15.82\n838\t    majority_baseline: 51.7\n839\t  result_rationale: 'Zero-shot judges极端biased toward \"fail\"：8B fail_recall 95.8% but\n840\t    pass_recall仅35.1%。 模型的zero-shot heuristic是\"mutated code = broken\"，几乎不考虑mutation是否actually\n841\t    affects test outcome。32B稍好(pass_recall 52.35%)但仍heavily biased。 Fine-tuned 4B\n842\t    (87.51%) >> 32B zero-shot (71.69%)，gap 15.82pp： task-specific fine-tuning的value\n843\t    massive。8x更大的零训练模型仍不如4x更小的微调模型。 Traj-level accuracy 99.1%是trivial：数据中仅1个resolved\n844\t    instance， judge只需default to \"unresolved\"即可达99%。这highlights traj-level accuracy的\n845\t    deceptive nature——per-test accuracy是更honest的metric。\n846\t\n847\t    '\n848\t  tables:\n849\t  - name: 'Table: Fine-Tuned vs Zero-Shot'\n850\t    columns:\n851\t    - Model\n852\t    - Method\n853\t    - Per-Test Acc\n854\t    - Fail F1\n855\t    - Pass F1\n856\t    rows:\n857\t    - - Qwen3-4B\n858\t      - Fine-tuned CLS\n859\t      - 87.51\n860\t      - 87.86\n861\t      - 87.15\n862\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n863\t      - Zero-shot\n864\t      - 64.4\n865\t      - 72.2\n866\t      - 50.5\n867\t    - - Qwen3-32B NF4\n868\t      - Zero-shot\n869\t      - 71.69\n870\t      - 75.91\n871\t      - 65.68\n872\t    - - Majority\n873\t      - Baseline\n874\t      - 51.7\n875\t      - —\n876\t      - —\n877\t  figures_description:\n878\t  - 'Accuracy-compute Pareto frontier: fine-tuned CLS dominates'\n879\t  analysis: 'Uncontroversial finding。Confirms fine-tuning necessity for code verification。\n880\t    Reviewer可能ask for few-shot or chain-of-thought baselines as additional reference。\n881\t\n882\t    '\n883\t- name: Per-Test Majority Voting (K=3)\n884\t  plan_id: per-test-majority-voting\n885\t  description: Self-consistency K=3 on per-test classification\n886\t  expected_results:\n887\t    accuracy_greedy: 87.51\n888\t    accuracy_mv_k3: 86.83\n889\t    delta_pp: -0.69\n890\t    unanimous_rate: 93.3\n891\t    split_samples: 127\n892\t    flipped_correct_to_wrong: 28\n893\t    flipped_wrong_to_correct: 15\n894\t    net_flips: -13\n895\t    wall_time_greedy_sec: 30\n896\t    wall_time_mv_sec: 120\n897\t  result_rationale: 'Majority voting hurt accuracy by 0.69pp。93.3% of predictions\n898\t    are unanimous—— model is highly confident, disagreement occurs only on 127/1890\n899\t    = 6.7% of samples。 These are the hardest borderline cases where model is genuinely\n900\t    uncertain。 Voting on uncertain cases flips 28 correct→wrong vs 15 wrong→correct\n901\t    (net -13)： the model''s first-pass greedy prediction is better than random among\n902\t    its own alternatives。 This is unlike LLM reasoning tasks where self-consistency\n903\t    helps——per-test classification is a discrimination task where greedy decoding\n904\t    already captures the optimal decision boundary。 4x compute cost for worse accuracy\n905\t    makes MV strictly dominated。\n906\t\n907\t    '\n908\t  tables:\n909\t  - name: 'Table (Appendix): Majority Voting'\n910\t    columns:\n911\t    - Method\n912\t    - Accuracy\n913\t    - Time(s)\n914\t    - Net Flips\n915\t    rows:\n916\t    - - Greedy (K=1)\n917\t      - 87.51\n918\t      - 30\n919\t      - —\n920\t    - - Majority (K=3)\n921\t      - 86.83\n922\t      - 120\n923\t      - −13\n924\t  figures_description: []\n925\t  analysis: 'Negative result in appendix。Self-consistency不适用于well-calibrated binary\n926\t    classifiers。\n927\t\n928\t    '\n929\t- name: 5-Seed Paired Clustered Bootstrap (TOST Equivalence)\n930\t  plan_id: 5-paired-clustered-bootstrap\n931\t  description: Per-test vs trajectory-level TOST equivalence with clustered bootstrap\n932\t  expected_results:\n933\t    pooled_gap_pp: -0.45\n934\t    pooled_ci_lower: -1.71\n935\t    pooled_ci_upper: 0.84\n936\t    ci_width_pp: 2.55\n937\t    tost_p_value: 0.0071\n938\t    tost_margin_pp: 2.0\n939\t    equivalence_confirmed: true\n940\t    per_seed_gaps:\n941\t      s42: -0.97\n942\t      s123: 1.45\n943\t      s456: -1.84\n944\t      s789: -0.78\n945\t      s0: -0.29\n946\t    seed_level_paired_t_p: 0.425\n947\t    n_variants_pooled: 523\n948\t    n_clusters: 114\n949\t    n_resamples: 10000\n950\t  result_rationale: 'TOST p=0.007 << 0.05 confirms per-test ≈ trajectory within ±2pp\n951\t    margin。 CI [-1.71, +0.84] width = 2.55pp在median range [1.5, 3.0]——sufficiently\n952\t    narrow to confirm equivalence but not extremely tight。 Per-seed gaps from -1.84\n953\t    to +1.45：方向不一致，3 seeds per-test worse,  1 seed per-test better, 1 seed near-zero。This\n954\t    inconsistency IS the equivalence signal—— if one formulation were systematically\n955\t    better, gaps would be consistently one-sided。 ±2pp margin justification: with\n956\t    ICC=0.191 and DEFF=3.97, 2pp is practical significance threshold given the reduced\n957\t    effective sample size。 Clustered bootstrap (114 clusters, 10000 resamples) accounts\n958\t    for within-problem correlation that would bias naive CI estimates。\n959\t\n960\t    '\n961\t  tables:\n962\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Test vs Trajectory Equivalence'\n963\t    columns:\n964\t    - Seed\n965\t    - Gap (per-test − traj, pp)\n966\t    - Direction\n967\t    rows:\n968\t    - - 42\n969\t      - -0.97\n970\t      - Traj better\n971\t    - - 123\n972\t      - 1.45\n973\t      - Per-test better\n974\t    - - 456\n975\t      - -1.84\n976\t      - Traj better\n977\t    - - 789\n978\t      - -0.78\n979\t      - Traj better\n980\t    - - 0\n981\t      - -0.29\n982\t      - Traj better\n983\t    - - Pooled\n984\t      - −0.45 [−1.71, +0.84]\n985\t      - TOST p=0.007\n986\t  figures_description:\n987\t  - 'Forest plot: per-seed gaps with pooled CI, ±2pp TOST bounds as dotted verticals'\n988\t  analysis: 'Claim 2的methodological cornerstone。TOST at p=0.007 is strong evidence。\n989\t    Median tier下这是paper最rigorous statistical result和primary contribution。\n990\t\n991\t    '\n992\t- name: CLS/CWM Error Complementarity Analysis\n993\t  plan_id: error-overlap\n994\t  description: CLS vs CWM error overlap on function-level (seed42, n=1890)\n995\t  expected_results:\n996\t    both_correct:\n997\t      count: 1601\n998\t      pct: 84.71\n999\t    cls_only_correct:\n1000\t      count: 59\n1001\t      pct: 3.12\n1002\t    cwm_only_correct:\n1003\t      count: 53\n1004\t      pct: 2.8\n1005\t    both_wrong:\n1006\t      count: 177\n1007\t      pct: 9.37\n1008\t    oracle_ensemble_accuracy: 90.63\n1009\t    cls_error_mode: miss bugs (FN dominant, 75.4% of CLS errors)\n1010\t    cwm_error_mode: false alarms (FP dominant, 83.1% of CWM errors)\n1011\t    cohens_kappa_predictions: 0.88\n1012\t    cohens_kappa_correctness: 0.73\n1013\t  result_rationale: 'CLS-only correct (3.12%) ≈ CWM-only correct (2.80%)说明两种formulation有近乎equal\n1014\t    but different错误区域。Oracle ensemble 90.63%远高于either alone(87.51%)。 Error mode complementarity：CLS倾向miss\n1015\t    bugs(conservative, FN dominant)， CWM倾向false alarm(overgenerate error outputs)。这不是random\n1016\t    complementarity 而是structural：CLS的binary decision boundary和CWM的string matching\n1017\t    在不同case types上fail。 Off_by_one最complementary(CWM-only 4.8%, both wrong 14.9%)：\n1018\t    CLS难以detect subtle boundary changes but CWM sometimes captures output differences。\n1019\t    Return_value最不complementary(96.8% both correct)：both formulations handle this\n1020\t    easily。 Kappa(correctness)=0.73 < Kappa(predictions)=0.88说明agreement on what''s\n1021\t    correct is lower than agreement on predictions——there''s a meaningful disagreement\n1022\t    zone。\n1023\t\n1024\t    '\n1025\t  tables:\n1026\t  - name: 'Table: Error Overlap (4B, seed42)'\n1027\t    columns:\n1028\t    - Category\n1029\t    - Count\n1030\t    - '%'\n1031\t    rows:\n1032\t    - - Both correct\n1033\t      - 1601\n1034\t      - 84.71%\n1035\t    - - CLS-only correct\n1036\t      - 59\n1037\t      - 3.12%\n1038\t    - - CWM-only correct\n1039\t      - 53\n1040\t      - 2.80%\n1041\t    - - Both wrong\n1042\t      - 177\n1043\t      - 9.37%\n1044\t    - - Oracle ensemble\n1045\t      - —\n1046\t      - 90.63%\n1047\t  figures_description:\n1048\t  - 'Venn diagram: CLS vs CWM error overlap'\n1049\t  - Per-mutation complementarity breakdown\n1050\t  analysis: 'Oracle ensemble 90.63%是paper的supplementary selling point。 Framing: \"formulation\n1051\t    diversity as a verification strategy\" —  even if neither CLS nor CWM individually\n1052\t    dominates, combining them yields 3.12pp lift。\n1053\t\n1054\t    '\n1055\t- name: DeepSeek Function-Level CLS (seed42)\n1056\t  plan_id: deepseek-cls-func\n1057\t  description: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CLS on function-level\n1058\t  expected_results:\n1059\t    accuracy: 86.8\n1060\t    pass_f1: 86.5\n1061\t    fail_f1: 87.1\n1062\t    unparseable: 0\n1063\t    vs_qwen_4b_cls_gap_pp: -0.71\n1064\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized model，parameter count略大于Qwen3-4B但\n1065\t    architecture不同(MoE-style vs dense)。在function-level CLS上达到~86.8%， 略低于Qwen 4B(87.51%)的0.71pp。差距可能来自：(1)\n1066\t    LoRA hyperparameters为Qwen优化过， DeepSeek可能需要不同rank/lr；(2) tokenizer差异影响code representation\n1067\t    quality； (3) instruction format差异(DeepSeek用自己的chat template)。 这说明CLS formulation对architecture\n1068\t    robust(差异<1pp)但不是完全invariant。 Median tier下DeepSeek CLS function-level confirms\n1069\t    CLS generalizability但无exciting finding。\n1070\t\n1071\t    '\n1072\t  tables: []\n1073\t  figures_description: []\n1074\t  analysis: 'Cross-architecture CLS works. Small performance gap likely attributable\n1075\t    to hyperparameter tuning.\n1076\t\n1077\t    '\n1078\t- name: DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed42)\n1079\t  plan_id: deepseek-cwm-func\n1080\t  description: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM on function-level\n1081\t  expected_results:\n1082\t    accuracy: 87.5\n1083\t    pass_f1: 87.3\n1084\t    fail_f1: 87.7\n1085\t    exact_match_rate: 85.1\n1086\t    unparseable: 0\n1087\t    vs_deepseek_cls_gap_pp: 0.7\n1088\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek CWM (87.5%) > DeepSeek CLS (86.8%)：gap = +0.7pp FAVORING\n1089\t    CWM。 这与Qwen finding(CLS略优)方向相反。原因推测：DeepSeek-Coder在code generation pretraining上更强，其generation\n1090\t    capability转移到execution output prediction上 比classification更efficiently。CWM在DeepSeek上exact_match\n1091\t    85.1% > Qwen的84.02%， suggesting DeepSeek生成output更precise。 This is the key median\n1092\t    tier prediction：\"mixed DeepSeek results\"—— CLS-CWM gap方向在DeepSeek上flipped，undermining\"CLS\n1093\t    universally better\"narrative。 deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp = -0.7，在[-2.0, 2.0]\n1094\t    range内。\n1095\t\n1096\t    '\n1097\t  tables: []\n1098\t  figures_description: []\n1099\t  analysis: 'Direction flip on DeepSeek is the defining \"mixed\" result。Paper must\n1100\t    acknowledge that CLS advantage may be architecture-specific rather than formulation-universal。\n1101\t\n1102\t    '\n1103\t- name: DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed123)\n1104\t  plan_id: deepseek-cwm-func-s123\n1105\t  description: Second seed for DeepSeek CWM stability check\n1106\t  expected_results:\n1107\t    accuracy: 86.9\n1108\t    pass_f1: 86.7\n1109\t    fail_f1: 87.1\n1110\t    exact_match_rate: 84.3\n1111\t    vs_seed42_gap_pp: -0.6\n1112\t  result_rationale: 'Seed123 CWM (86.9%) 低于 seed42 (87.5%) 0.6pp——正常seed variance\n1113\t    range。 如果DeepSeek CLS也跑seed123(假设~86.5%)，CLS-CWM gap ≈ -0.4pp(CWM slightly better)。\n1114\t    两个seeds下gap = {seed42: -0.7, seed123: ~-0.4}，方向一致(CWM better on DeepSeek) 但effect\n1115\t    size小。Cross-seed一致性比Qwen好(Qwen的CLS-CWM gap从+0.32到+2.33 across seeds)。\n1116\t\n1117\t    '\n1118\t  tables:\n1119\t  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Function-Level Summary'\n1120\t    columns:\n1121\t    - Seed\n1122\t    - DeepSeek CLS\n1123\t    - DeepSeek CWM\n1124\t    - Gap (CLS−CWM)\n1125\t    rows:\n1126\t    - - 42\n1127\t      - ~86.8\n1128\t      - 87.5\n1129\t      - −0.7\n1130\t    - - 123\n1131\t      - —\n1132\t      - 86.9\n1133\t      - —\n1134\t  figures_description: []\n1135\t  analysis: 'DeepSeek CWM ≥ CLS consistently across seeds. Combined with Qwen (CLS\n1136\t    > CWM), the cross-architecture story is: formulation advantage is model-dependent,\n1137\t    not universal.\n1138\t\n1139\t    '\n1140\t- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS\n1141\t  plan_id: deepseek-cls-repo\n1142\t  description: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B fine-tuned CLS on repo-level SWE-bench data\n1143\t  expected_results:\n1144\t    accuracy: 80.5\n1145\t    f1_macro: 71.8\n1146\t    fail_f1: 61.2\n1147\t    pass_f1: 82.4\n1148\t    unparseable_pct: 2.1\n1149\t    majority_baseline: 73.0\n1150\t    gap_vs_baseline_pp: 7.5\n1151\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek repo-level CLS (80.5%) 在Qwen 4B(82.35%) 和 8B(84.79%)之间，\n1152\t    符合其~6.7B parameter count。Fail_f1 61.2%在median range [60,72]。 Unparseable 2.1%略高于Qwen(0-1.3%)——DeepSeek\n1153\t    tokenizer对repo-level formatting edge cases处理稍差。Gap vs majority baseline (7.5pp)说明model\n1154\t    learned meaningful signal 但比Qwen的9-12pp gap小，可能因为hyperparameter没有充分tune for repo-level。\n1155\t    Median tier意义：partial confirmation that CLS works on repo-level across architectures，\n1156\t    但performance水平无new insight(comparable to Qwen within normal variance)。\n1157\t\n1158\t    '\n1159\t  tables:\n1160\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Architecture Repo-Level CLS'\n1161\t    columns:\n1162\t    - Model\n1163\t    - Accuracy\n1164\t    - Fail F1\n1165\t    - Unparseable%\n1166\t    rows:\n1167\t    - - Qwen3-4B (best seed)\n1168\t      - 82.35\n1169\t      - 60.87\n1170\t      - 1.3\n1171\t    - - Qwen3-8B (best seed)\n1172\t      - 84.79\n1173\t      - 72.93\n1174\t      - 0\n1175\t    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n1176\t      - ~80.5\n1177\t      - ~61.2\n1178\t      - ~2.1\n1179\t  figures_description:\n1180\t  - Cross-architecture repo-level CLS accuracy comparison\n1181\t  analysis: 'Confirms CLS repo-level viability across architectures but adds no dramatic\n1182\t    new evidence。 In paper: single line in results table, brief mention in text。\n1183\t\n1184\t    '\n1185\t- name: Repo-Level CLS Mutation-Type Analysis\n1186\t  plan_id: repo-mutation-analysis\n1187\t  description: Per-mutation-type accuracy breakdown for repo-level CLS 8B\n1188\t  expected_results:\n1189\t    overall_accuracy: 84.48\n1190\t    gold_accuracy: 96.24\n1191\t    operator_swap: 81.38\n1192\t    off_by_one: 86.89\n1193\t    return_value: 75.44\n1194\t    boundary_removal: 46.9\n1195\t    seed123_overall: 85.6\n1196\t    seed123_boundary_removal: 44.9\n1197\t    seed123_gold: 99.6\n1198\t  result_rationale: 'Boundary_removal极低(46.9%)——接近random guessing。这类mutation移除了if/while条件判断，\n1199\t    导致代码行为大幅改变但模型难以仅从code+test text判断影响。 Return_value也低(75.4%)：返回值变化在repo-level context中更难捕获因为\n1200\t    函数调用链更长，影响propagation更complex。 Gold accuracy高(96-99%)说明模型对未mutated code的判断reliable。\n1201\t    Off_by_one在repo-level(86.9%)比function-level(82.56%)还高——可能因为 repo-level tests更explicitly\n1202\t    test boundary conditions。 Median tier下此breakdown explains为什么repo-level fail_f1\n1203\t    only 60-73%： boundary_removal(占test set 10.7%)严重拖低整体fail detection。\n1204\t\n1205\t    '\n1206\t  tables:\n1207\t  - name: 'Table: Repo-Level CLS 8B Mutation Breakdown'\n1208\t    columns:\n1209\t    - Mutation Type\n1210\t    - Accuracy (s42)\n1211\t    - Accuracy (s123)\n1212\t    rows:\n1213\t    - - Gold (no mutation)\n1214\t      - 96.24%\n1215\t      - 99.60%\n1216\t    - - operator_swap\n1217\t      - 81.38%\n1218\t      - 82.60%\n1219\t    - - off_by_one\n1220\t      - 86.89%\n1221\t      - 79.20%\n1222\t    - - return_value\n1223\t      - 75.44%\n1224\t      - 66.40%\n1225\t    - - boundary_removal\n1226\t      - 46.90%\n1227\t      - 44.90%\n1228\t  figures_description:\n1229\t  - 'Radar chart: mutation-type accuracy across models (func 4B, repo 4B, repo 8B)'\n1230\t  analysis: Boundary_removal is the Achilles heel. Represents instances where CLS\n1231\t    cannot determine test outcome from static code analysis alone — would need execution-like\n1232\t    reasoning。 This partially validates CWM's approach (predicting execution) for\n1233\t    specific mutation types。\n1234\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ef6bd922-f0b7-4766-ae72-4d9300a35f00","uuid":"c8ea5c0d-5f69-42dc-a366-c435638326cd","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:14:27.270Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073712/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: 'Median档叙事核心转变：Claim1从\"CLS>CWM\"降级为\"CLS works where CWM fails\"。\n  Function-level 4B null result (0pp gap, p=0.72) + 8B 2.43pp modest gap被接受但不视为exciting。\n  Repo-level CLS可用(82-85% accuracy)但CWM catastrophically fail(50-93% unparseable)，\n  部分reviewer质疑CWM failure是implementation问题(max_new_tokens设置、output format设计) 而非formulation固有限制，要求honest\n  discussion。 重心转向Claim2+3：per-test equivalence(TOST p=0.007, ±2pp)作为methodological\n  contribution， oracle characterization(T≥2 advantage集中在31.3% instances)作为practical\n  decision framework。 DeepSeek结果mixed——function-level gap方向不一致(CWM在DeepSeek上可能略优)，\n  repo-level CLS可用但无new insight。 Error complementarity(oracle ensemble 90.63%)成为supplementary\n  selling point。 仍可投EMNLP main但需strengthened related work、honest CWM limitations section。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: CWM Generation Baseline (4B Function-Level)\n  plan_id: cwm-baseline\n  description: Qwen3-4B LoRA CWM vs CLS on function-level data, seed42\n  expected_results:\n    cls_accuracy: 87.51\n    cls_pass_f1: 87.1\n    cls_fail_f1: 87.9\n    cwm_accuracy: 87.51\n    cwm_pass_f1: 87.31\n    cwm_fail_f1: 87.71\n    accuracy_gap_pp: 0.0\n    cwm_exact_match_rate: 84.02\n    cwm_unparseable: 0\n  result_rationale: 'Function-level execution output短(通常<50 tokens)，CWM不触发token-budget\n    exhaustion 或string-value prediction failure modes。4B模型容量足以精确预测短输出。 两种formulation在此complexity\n    level达到identical accuracy(87.51%)。 Exact match rate 84.02% < accuracy 87.51%说明CWM有部分output不完全匹配但\n    通过pass/fail判断逻辑仍然correct——这预示repo-level上output matching会更困难。 Unparseable=0因为function-level输出格式统一简单。\n    Median tier下此null result是叙事基础：排除\"CLS trivially easier\"的concern， 建立complexity-dependent\n    advantage的前提。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Function-Level 4B CLS vs CWM (seed42)'\n    columns:\n    - Formulation\n    - Accuracy\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    - Exact Match\n    - Unparseable%\n    rows:\n    - - CLS\n      - 87.51\n      - 87.1\n      - 87.9\n      - N/A\n      - 0\n    - - CWM\n      - 87.51\n      - 87.31\n      - 87.71\n      - 84.02\n      - 0\n    - - Δ (CLS−CWM)\n      - 0.0\n      - −0.21\n      - 0.19\n      - —\n      - 0\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-class F1 bar chart, CLS与CWM几乎完全重叠\n  analysis: 'Null result confirmed. CWM exact_match (84.02%) < accuracy (87.51%)的gap(3.49pp)\n    暗示CWM在部分case上output不精确匹配但仍被判为correct—— repo-level上这个gap会急剧扩大导致catastrophic failure。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-Seed Core Validation (5-seed, 4B)\n  plan_id: multi-seed-core\n  description: CLS 5-seed {42,123,456,789,0} + CWM 5-seed统计\n  expected_results:\n    cls_seeds:\n      s42:\n        accuracy: 87.83\n        pass_f1: 88.06\n        fail_f1: 87.59\n      s123:\n        accuracy: 89.52\n        pass_f1: 89.64\n        fail_f1: 89.4\n      s456:\n        accuracy: 87.88\n        pass_f1: 87.53\n        fail_f1: 88.21\n      s789:\n        accuracy: 89.0\n        pass_f1: 88.9\n        fail_f1: 89.1\n      s0:\n        accuracy: 87.94\n        pass_f1: 87.79\n        fail_f1: 88.08\n    cls_mean_accuracy: 88.43\n    cls_std_accuracy: 0.76\n    cwm_seeds:\n      s42:\n        accuracy: 87.51\n        pass_f1: 87.31\n        fail_f1: 87.71\n      s123:\n        accuracy: 87.2\n        pass_f1: 86.95\n        fail_f1: 87.44\n      s456:\n        accuracy: 86.98\n        pass_f1: 86.66\n        fail_f1: 87.29\n      s789:\n        accuracy: 86.67\n        pass_f1: 86.74\n        fail_f1: 86.6\n      s0:\n        accuracy: 87.57\n        pass_f1: 87.18\n        fail_f1: 87.93\n    cwm_mean_accuracy: 87.19\n    cwm_std_accuracy: 0.36\n    mean_gap_pp: 1.24\n    paired_t_p: ~0.06\n    significant_at_005: false\n  result_rationale: 'CLS 5-seed mean 88.43 vs CWM 87.19, gap 1.24pp。Paired t-test\n    p≈0.06，α=0.05下不显著。 CLS variance (std 0.76) > CWM (std 0.36)：CLS对LoRA初始化更敏感，因为binary\n    classification 的decision boundary位置对seed更敏感；CWM的generation target更deterministic，\n    不同seed主要影响generation fluency而非correctness。 Seed123是CLS的outlier high(89.52)和CWM的near-mean(87.20)，贡献了最大pair\n    gap。 Median tier：trend存在但不conclusive，这是4B function-level的inherent limitation——\n    task太简单，两种formulation的capacity均已饱和。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 4B 5-Seed CLS vs CWM'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - CLS Acc\n    - CWM Acc\n    - Gap (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 87.83\n      - 87.51\n      - 0.32\n    - - 123\n      - 89.52\n      - 87.2\n      - 2.32\n    - - 456\n      - 87.88\n      - 86.98\n      - 0.9\n    - - 789\n      - 89.0\n      - 86.67\n      - 2.33\n    - - 0\n      - 87.94\n      - 87.57\n      - 0.37\n    - - Mean±Std\n      - 88.43±0.76\n      - 87.19±0.36\n      - '+1.24'\n  figures_description:\n  - 5-seed accuracy dot plot with mean ± std bars, CLS蓝色、CWM橙色\n  analysis: 'p≈0.06处于borderline。Paper报告为\"directional trend (p=0.06) at 4B,  becomes\n    significant at 8B\"，building scaling narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: Trace-then-Judge Ablation\n  plan_id: trace-then-judge\n  description: 'Chain-of-thought style: generate reasoning trace → pass/fail'\n  expected_results:\n    training_status: failed\n    reason: output format instability, training diverged\n  result_rationale: '4B LoRA同时学习生成reasoning trace和predict pass/fail，两个objective竞争有限capacity。\n    Trace format不稳定导致pass/fail token被reasoning token侵蚀，accuracy崩溃。 这不是fundamental\n    impossibility而是engineering/capacity问题——更大模型或更精细的 format control可能解决。Median tier下dropped\n    from paper，brief mention in limitations。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '不影响core claims。如果成功，它会ablate away\"CLS优势来自skipping reasoning\"的concern；\n    failure意味着这个concern无法directly addressed，但8B scaling evidence间接addresses。\n\n    '\n- name: Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\n  plan_id: traj-level-finetuned\n  description: 4B LoRA trained on resolved/unresolved prediction (5-seed)\n  expected_results:\n    seed42:\n      accuracy: 85.66\n      unresolved_f1: 87.5\n      resolved_f1: 83.18\n      consistency: 79.94\n    seed123:\n      accuracy: 85.47\n      unresolved_f1: 87.0\n      resolved_f1: 83.52\n      consistency: 78.59\n    seed456:\n      accuracy: 87.4\n      unresolved_f1: 88.7\n      resolved_f1: 85.8\n      consistency: 78.8\n    seed789:\n      accuracy: 87.31\n      unresolved_f1: 88.27\n      resolved_f1: 86.17\n      consistency: 76.74\n    seed0:\n      accuracy: 85.66\n      unresolved_f1: 87.37\n      resolved_f1: 83.41\n      consistency: 79.55\n    mean_accuracy: 86.3\n    std_accuracy: 0.93\n  result_rationale: 'Trajectory-level mean accuracy 86.30% vs per-test CLS 88.43%，gap\n    2.13pp。 这个gap的主要来源：(1) trajectory-level每个problem只产生1个训练样本 vs per-test产生T个， effective\n    training data量更少；(2) resolved需要ALL tests pass——这种conjunctive logic 比per-test的individual判断更难学。Consistency\n    rate ~78%说明同一problem内per-test predictions 有~22%不一致，暗示model在同一problem内对不同tests的判断受shared\n    context bias影响。 Median tier下此gap supports Claim 2的\"per-test不损失accuracy\"叙事，但gap部分\n    来自training data confound，需honest报告。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Trajectory-Level 5-Seed Results'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Accuracy\n    - Resolved F1\n    - Unresolved F1\n    - Consistency%\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 85.66\n      - 83.18\n      - 87.5\n      - 79.94\n    - - 123\n      - 85.47\n      - 83.52\n      - 87.0\n      - 78.59\n    - - 456\n      - 87.4\n      - 85.8\n      - 88.7\n      - 78.8\n    - - 789\n      - 87.31\n      - 86.17\n      - 88.27\n      - 76.74\n    - - 0\n      - 85.66\n      - 83.41\n      - 87.37\n      - 79.55\n    - - Mean±Std\n      - 86.30±0.93\n      - 84.42±1.36\n      - 87.77±0.68\n      - 78.72±1.25\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Per-test ≥ trajectory at variant-level，TOST equivalence test (下述) 更rigorously\n    quantifies。\n\n    '\n- name: Model Size Scaling (8B, 3-seed)\n  plan_id: model-size-scaling\n  description: CLS vs CWM at 8B scale, seeds {42, 123, 456}\n  expected_results:\n    cls8b_seeds:\n      s42:\n        accuracy: 90.48\n        pass_f1: 90.86\n        fail_f1: 90.06\n      s123:\n        accuracy: 89.4\n        pass_f1: 89.54\n        fail_f1: 89.19\n      s456:\n        accuracy: 88.31\n        pass_f1: 88.2\n        fail_f1: 88.41\n    cls8b_mean_accuracy: 89.4\n    cls8b_std: 1.09\n    cwm8b_seeds:\n      s42:\n        accuracy: 87.67\n        pass_f1: 87.57\n        fail_f1: 87.77\n      s123:\n        accuracy: 86.98\n        pass_f1: 86.83\n        fail_f1: 87.13\n      s456:\n        accuracy: 86.24\n        pass_f1: 85.96\n        fail_f1: 86.51\n    cwm8b_mean_accuracy: 86.96\n    cwm8b_std: 0.72\n    mean_gap_pp: 2.43\n    per_seed_gaps:\n      s42: 2.81\n      s123: 2.42\n      s456: 2.07\n    cls_4b_to_8b_gain_pp: 0.97\n    cwm_4b_to_8b_gain_pp: -0.23\n  result_rationale: '8B CLS (89.40) vs CWM (86.96) gap扩大到2.43pp，所有3个seed方向一致(2.07-2.81pp)。\n    关键asymmetry：CLS从4B→8B提升0.97pp但CWM下降0.23pp。 CWM在8B未获益的原因：function-level generation的bottleneck在exact\n    string matching， 不是semantic understanding。额外的8B capacity没有reduce string matching\n    error—— 模型更好地\"理解\"了代码但仍然在output format上犯同样的errors。 CLS则从extra capacity中获益：binary\n    classification的decision boundary在高维space中 变得更smooth，reducing borderline case errors。\n    Median tier：2.43pp被接受为real but modest。Reviewer说\"interesting but not dramatic\"。\n    结合repo-level的catastrophic CWM failure讲故事：function-level hints at差异， repo-level放大为qualitative\n    failure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 8B 3-Seed Scaling'\n    columns:\n    - Size\n    - CLS Mean Acc\n    - CWM Mean Acc\n    - Gap (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 4B (5-seed)\n      - 88.43\n      - 87.19\n      - 1.24\n    - - 8B (seed42)\n      - 90.48\n      - 87.67\n      - 2.81\n    - - 8B (seed123)\n      - 89.4\n      - 86.98\n      - 2.42\n    - - 8B (seed456)\n      - 88.31\n      - 86.24\n      - 2.07\n    - - 8B (3-seed mean)\n      - 89.4\n      - 86.96\n      - 2.43\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scaling plot: x=model size, y=accuracy, CLS和CWM两条线, 8B处diverge'\n  - Per-seed gap bar chart, 3 bars all positive (2.07-2.81)\n  analysis: '8B gap consistent across seeds is the function-level strongest evidence\n    for Claim 1。 但2.43pp在absolute terms仍modest。Paper frame为\"scaling direction\"而非\"large\n    effect\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Diagnostic Re-Repair (Downstream Proof-of-Concept)\n  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n  description: Per-test failure predictions用于guide SWE-agent re-repair on 200 instances\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances_evaluated: 120\n    baseline_resolve_rate_pct: 24.2\n    with_pertest_resolve_rate_pct: 28.3\n    improvement_pp: 4.1\n    p_value_mcnemar: 0.11\n    significant_at_005: false\n    instances_diagnostic_helped: 14\n    instances_diagnostic_hurt: 9\n    net_helped: 5\n    avg_repair_attempts_baseline: 3.2\n    avg_repair_attempts_diagnostic: 2.8\n  result_rationale: 'Median tier下re-repair受三重限制：(1) 资源不足仅完成120/200 instances； (2)\n    per-test verifier error rate ~12.5%意味着约1/8的diagnostic信号是错误的， misleading repair\n    agent在错误方向搜索；(3) SWE-bench instances 68.7% T=1， 这些case per-test info退化为trajectory-level，不提供额外guidance。\n    4.1pp improvement方向正确，repair attempts减少(3.2→2.8)说明diagnostic确实 narrow了search space。但p=0.11在120\n    samples下不显著(power analysis显示需~400 instances)。 Net helped仅5(14-9)，说明diagnostic\n    precision不够——错误诊断导致9个case regression。 Median tier将此relegated to appendix/future\n    work，不作为main claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table (Appendix): Re-Repair Pilot Results'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Resolve Rate\n    - Avg Attempts\n    - N\n    rows:\n    - - Baseline (no per-test)\n      - 24.2%\n      - 3.2\n      - 120\n    - - With per-test diagnostic\n      - 28.3%\n      - 2.8\n      - 120\n    - - Δ\n      - +4.1pp (p=0.11)\n      - −0.4\n      - ''\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired comparison: helped(14) vs hurt(9) vs neutral(97) breakdown'\n  analysis: 'Directional but non-significant。Paper frame: \"preliminary evidence for\n    diagnostic utility, limited by verifier accuracy and sample size; full evaluation\n    left to future work.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Test Precision/Recall Analysis\n  plan_id: per-test-precision-recall\n  description: Per-test failure prediction quality on full function-level test set\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 87.51\n    fail_precision: 82.75\n    fail_recall: 93.64\n    fail_f1: 87.86\n    pass_precision: 93.24\n    pass_recall: 81.8\n    pass_f1: 87.15\n    FP_count: 58\n    FN_count: 178\n    FP_FN_ratio: 0.326\n    best_mutation: return_value (97.26%)\n    worst_mutation: off_by_one (82.56%)\n    bucket_6_10_acc: 96.3\n    bucket_11plus_acc: 87.12\n  result_rationale: '模型显著biased toward predicting fail：fail_recall(93.64%) >> pass_recall(81.80%)。\n    这是因为training data中mutation几乎都导致fail，模型学到了conservative prior。 FP:FN = 58:178 →\n    75.4% of errors are false negatives(miss actual fails)。 这quantifies CLS的characteristic\n    failure mode：\"miss bugs\"而非\"false alarms\"。 Mutation类型分析：return_value最容易(97.26%)因为return值变化导致output大幅改变；\n    off_by_one最难(82.56%)因为边界条件变化subtle，模型需要precise numerical reasoning。 Bucket analysis：6-10\n    tests的problems accuracy最高(96.3%)因为multiple tests 提供redundant signal；11+ tests降至87.12%因为input\n    length增加导致attention稀释。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Test Diagnostic Quality'\n    columns:\n    - Class\n    - Precision\n    - Recall\n    - F1\n    rows:\n    - - Fail (bug detected)\n      - 82.75\n      - 93.64\n      - 87.86\n    - - Pass (correct code)\n      - 93.24\n      - 81.8\n      - 87.15\n  - name: 'Table: Accuracy by Mutation Type'\n    columns:\n    - Mutation\n    - Accuracy\n    rows:\n    - - return_value\n      - 97.26%\n    - - variable_swap\n      - ~94%\n    - - operator_swap\n      - ~88%\n    - - off_by_one\n      - 82.56%\n  figures_description:\n  - Confusion matrix heatmap\n  - Accuracy by mutation type + test count bucket grouped bar chart\n  analysis: 'Error asymmetry (75% FN) 对downstream re-repair的影响：diagnostic signal会\n    under-report failures，导致repair agent可能miss真正的bug。 这与CWM的complementary failure\n    mode(83% false alarms)形成对比，支持oracle ensemble叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\n  plan_id: oracle-f2p-stratified\n  description: Per-test advantage breakdown by FAIL_TO_PASS test count\n  expected_results:\n    T1_pct: 68.7\n    T1_block_adv: -0.09\n    T2_pct: 19.1\n    T2_block_adv: 31.69\n    T3_5_pct: 7.1\n    T3_5_block_adv: 40.74\n    T6plus_pct: 5.1\n    T6plus_block_adv: 40.06\n    overall_block_adv: 10.93\n    T2_contribution_pct: 55.3\n  result_rationale: 'T=1时per-test ≡ trajectory-level（只有一个fail test），advantage仅来自prediction\n    accuracy 微小差异（-0.09pp，essentially zero）。T=2时per-test advantage跳到31.69pp(block\n    model)： 原因是trajectory-level把两个tests的pass/fail合并为一个binary判断，丢失了which test failed的信息；\n    per-test分别预测，在一个test correct另一个wrong时仍能partial credit。 T≥3的advantage plateau在~40pp因为边际tests的marginal\n    information增量递减。 T2贡献55.3%的overall advantage因为它是最大的multi-test bucket(19.1%)且advantage显著。\n    Key insight for median tier：SWE-bench Verified 68.7%是T=1，限制了per-test的 population-level\n    impact。但targeting T≥2 subset (31.3%)时per-test显著优于trajectory。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Oracle Per-Test Advantage by F2P Count'\n    columns:\n    - T\n    - '% Instances'\n    - Block Adv (pp)\n    - Contribution to Overall\n    rows:\n    - - T=1\n      - 68.7\n      - -0.09\n      - −0.6%\n    - - T=2\n      - 19.1\n      - 31.69\n      - 55.3%\n    - - T=3−5\n      - 7.1\n      - 40.74\n      - 26.4%\n    - - T≥6\n      - 5.1\n      - 40.06\n      - 18.7%\n    - - Overall\n      - 100\n      - 10.93\n      - 100%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: per-test advantage by T bucket with instance % overlay'\n  - SWE-bench F2P count distribution histogram\n  analysis: 'Claim 3的primary evidence。Actionable finding：deploy per-test only when\n    T≥2。 This characterization is the paper''s strongest unique contribution in median\n    tier。\n\n    '\n- name: Oracle Total (F2P+P2P) Validation\n  plan_id: oracle-total-validated\n  description: When P2P regression detection adds value vs hurts\n  expected_results:\n    total_reg5pct:\n      iid_adv: -0.01\n      block_adv: -0.005\n      beneficial: false\n    total_reg10pct:\n      iid_adv: 0.132\n      block_adv: 0.083\n      beneficial: true\n    total_reg20pct:\n      iid_adv: 0.357\n      block_adv: 0.278\n      beneficial: true\n    empirical_p2p_regression_rate: ~0.01\n  result_rationale: 'Empirical P2P regression rate仅~1%，远低于10%的breakeven threshold。\n    5% regression下per-test P2P monitoring实际HURTS(-0.01pp)：false positive P2P predictions\n    导致correct patches被wrongly rejected。只有当regression rate≥10%时， true positive detection才outweigh\n    false positive cost。 这是negative但highly informative finding。当前SWE-bench patch质量高，\n    几乎不break passing tests——但real-world场景中regression rate可能更高。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: P2P Regression Threshold'\n    columns:\n    - Regression Rate\n    - Per-Test Adv (IID)\n    - Beneficial?\n    rows:\n    - - 1% (empirical)\n      - ≈0\n      - 'No'\n    - - 5%\n      - -0.01\n      - 'No'\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.132\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - 20%\n      - 0.357\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - Regression rate vs per-test advantage curve with breakeven point marked\n  analysis: 'Honest negative finding。Strengthens paper credibility by showing nuanced\n    analysis rather than overclaiming P2P utility。\n\n    '\n- name: Block Correlation Empirical Validation\n  plan_id: block-corr-empirical\n  description: Measured ICC and design effect from trained model predictions\n  expected_results:\n    icc: 0.1909\n    icc_p_value: 0.0\n    design_effect: 3.9676\n    all_correct_observed: 46\n    all_correct_expected_iid: 16.35\n    all_correct_ratio: 2.81\n    error_std_observed: 0.1531\n    error_std_expected_iid: 0.0811\n    error_std_ratio: 1.89\n    n_samples: 1890\n    n_problems: 114\n  result_rationale: 'ICC=0.191说明19.1%的prediction error variance is between-problem(problem-level\n    effect)。 这显著高于iid的0%(p<0.001)但远低于full block correlation(ICC=1.0)。 Design effect\n    3.97意味着effective sample size = nominal/3.97， justifies ±2pp TOST margin：在effective\n    N更小时，2pp是practical equivalence。 All-correct ratio 2.81x：观测到46个全对problem vs iid预期16.35个。\n    模型对某些problems consistently correct(可能这些code patterns简单)， 对另一些consistently wrong(可能涉及complex\n    logic)——errors不是random per-test。 Median tier下ICC=0.19是moderate，supports block\n    model但effect size温和。 Oracle analysis中的block curve是upper bound，iid curve是lower\n    bound， reality在两者之间但closer to iid端。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Error Correlation Validation'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Observed\n    - IID Expected\n    - Ratio\n    rows:\n    - - All-correct problems\n      - 46\n      - 16.35\n      - 2.81×\n    - - Error rate std\n      - 0.153\n      - 0.081\n      - 1.89×\n    - - ICC\n      - 0.191\n      - 0\n      - —\n    - - Design Effect\n      - 3.97\n      - 1.0\n      - 3.97×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-problem error rate distribution: observed vs IID-expected histogram overlay'\n  analysis: 'Validates block correlation assumption partially. The realistic per-test\n    advantage is between IID and block curves. Paper should present both bounds with\n    empirical ICC as the arbitrator rather than claiming only the optimistic block\n    estimate.\n\n    '\n- name: SWE-bench PerTest Dataset Construction\n  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n  description: Docker re-evaluation of 500 SWE-bench Verified instances × 16 candidates\n  expected_results:\n    target_instances: 500\n    successful_instances: 435\n    failed_instances: 65\n    success_rate_pct: 87.0\n    total_candidate_evaluations: 6960\n    total_pertest_labels: ~68000\n    avg_tests_per_instance: 156\n    avg_f2p_tests: 2.8\n    avg_p2p_tests: 153\n    p2p_regression_rate: 0.013\n    avg_code_tokens: 2800\n    construction_time_hours: 22\n  result_rationale: '65/500 Docker failures(13%)主要因为legacy Python packages unavailable\n    in 2026、 特定版本pinning broken、Docker image build timeouts for large repos。 435 instances足以support\n    repo-level training(350 train/85 test split approx)。 F2P stats与SWE-bench metadata一致(median\n    T=1, mean T=2.8)。 P2P regression rate ~1.3%再次confirms低regression率——P2P维度信号弱。 Code\n    tokens ~2800远超function-level的~200，这是repo-level generalization challenge的根源： 模型必须在10x更长的input上做judgment，attention\n    dilution显著。 Median tier下data collection是infrastructure contribution，paper brief\n    mention， detailed stats in appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table (Appendix): SWE-bench-PerTest Stats'\n    columns:\n    - Statistic\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Instances (successful)\n      - 435\n    - - Candidates/instance\n      - 16\n    - - Per-test labels\n      - ~68K\n    - - Avg F2P tests\n      - 2.8\n    - - Avg code tokens\n      - 2800\n    - - P2P regression rate\n      - 1.3%\n  figures_description:\n  - Test count distribution (F2P vs P2P)\n  analysis: 'Sufficient data for repo-level experiments. Docker failure rate acceptable.\n    P2P regression rate confirms prior negative finding.\n\n    '\n- name: Repo-Level Training (CLS + CWM, multi-attempt)\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: Repo-level CLS at 4B/8B + CWM attempts, checkpoint sweeps\n  expected_results:\n    cls_4b_best:\n      accuracy: 82.35\n      f1_macro: 74.74\n      fail_f1: 60.87\n      pass_f1: 88.6\n      fail_precision: 76.0\n      fail_recall: 50.76\n      unparseable_pct: 1.3\n    cls_4b_seed123_test:\n      accuracy: 75.33\n      fail_f1: 50.5\n    cls_8b_best:\n      accuracy: 84.79\n      f1_macro: 81.18\n      fail_f1: 72.93\n      pass_f1: 89.43\n      unparseable_pct: 0\n    cls_8b_seed123:\n      accuracy: 85.6\n      fail_f1: 65.89\n    cls_8b_multiseed_mean_accuracy: 85.2\n    cls_8b_multiseed_fail_f1_mean: 69.41\n    cwm_v10:\n      accuracy: 69.91\n      unparseable_pct: 93.0\n      fail_f1: 11.54\n    cwm_v12:\n      accuracy: 58.04\n      unparseable_pct: 53.7\n      fail_f1: 34.12\n    cwm_seed123:\n      accuracy: 59.09\n      unparseable_pct: 67.2\n    cwm_8b_attempts: all failed (training/eval infrastructure issues)\n  result_rationale: 'Repo-level CLS在median range内：8B multi-seed mean ~85%在[80,85]上缘，\n    fail_f1 ~69%在[60,72]内。Minority class(fail)预测弱的原因： repo-level code长(2800+ tokens)使模型难以精确定位failure\n    cause， fail recall低(50-56%)说明模型对大量fail case预测为pass——conservative model under-diagnoses\n    failures。Fail precision较好(76-92%)说明当模型predict fail时通常correct。\n\n    CWM catastrophic failure：93%(v10)或53.7%(v12)或67.2%(seed123) unparseable。 原因是repo-level\n    execution output极长(tracebacks、assertion details、log messages)， generation model无法produce\n    matching output。Max_new_tokens限制(64 in v10)导致 几乎所有output被truncated。即使放宽到1024 tokens(v11)，仍有75.2%\n    unparseable。\n\n    Median tier核心tension：CWM failure是formulation limitation还是implementation issue？\n    Reviewer会argue：(1) max_new_tokens太短是implementation choice；(2) better output format\n    (structured JSON vs raw string)可能reduce unparseable。Paper需要honest discussion：\n    \"even with generous token budget, CWM unparseable rate remains >50%, suggesting\n    formulation-level difficulty in predicting complex execution outputs.\"\n\n    4B seed variance高(82.35 vs 75.33)是concern——对checkpoint selection敏感。 8B更稳定(84.79\n    vs 85.60)因为更大model对hyperparameter less sensitive。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Repo-Level CLS vs CWM'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Formulation\n    - Best Acc\n    - Fail F1\n    - Unparseable%\n    rows:\n    - - 4B\n      - CLS (seed42)\n      - 82.35\n      - 60.87\n      - 1.3\n    - - 4B\n      - CLS (seed123)\n      - 75.33\n      - 50.5\n      - 0\n    - - 8B\n      - CLS (seed42)\n      - 84.79\n      - 72.93\n      - 0\n    - - 8B\n      - CLS (seed123)\n      - 85.6\n      - 65.89\n      - 0\n    - - 4B\n      - CWM (v10)\n      - 69.91\n      - 11.54\n      - 93.0\n    - - 4B\n      - CWM (v12)\n      - 58.04\n      - 34.12\n      - 53.7\n    - - 4B\n      - CWM (seed123)\n      - 59.09\n      - —\n      - 67.2\n  - name: 'Table: Complexity-Dependent Formulation Gap'\n    columns:\n    - Level\n    - CLS Best Acc\n    - CWM Best Acc\n    - CWM Unparseable%\n    rows:\n    - - Function (4B)\n      - 87.51\n      - 87.51\n      - 0\n    - - Function (8B)\n      - 90.48\n      - 87.67\n      - 0\n    - - Repo (4B)\n      - 82.35\n      - 69.91\n      - 93.0\n    - - Repo (8B)\n      - 84.79\n      - failed\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - CLS checkpoint accuracy curve (4B and 8B, test set)\n  - CWM unparseable rate across 10+ training attempts timeline\n  - Function vs Repo level CLS/CWM gap visualization\n  analysis: 'Repo-level是paper最contentious evidence。Framing必须是\"CLS works where CWM\n    fails\" 而非\"CLS beats CWM\"——因为CWM没有fair comparison point（它根本无法produce valid output）。\n    Reviewer concern mitigation：show multiple CWM attempts with different configs，\n    demonstrate that unparseable rate persists despite engineering effort。\n\n    '\n- name: LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\n  plan_id: llm-judge-baseline\n  description: Qwen3-8B and 32B NF4 zero-shot judge baselines\n  expected_results:\n    judge_8b:\n      accuracy: 64.4\n      fail_f1: 72.2\n      fail_recall: 95.8\n      pass_recall: 35.1\n      traj_accuracy: 99.1\n    judge_32b:\n      accuracy: 71.69\n      fail_f1: 75.91\n      fail_recall: 92.43\n      pass_recall: 52.35\n    finetuned_4b:\n      accuracy: 87.51\n    finetuned_vs_judge_32b_gap_pp: 15.82\n    majority_baseline: 51.7\n  result_rationale: 'Zero-shot judges极端biased toward \"fail\"：8B fail_recall 95.8% but\n    pass_recall仅35.1%。 模型的zero-shot heuristic是\"mutated code = broken\"，几乎不考虑mutation是否actually\n    affects test outcome。32B稍好(pass_recall 52.35%)但仍heavily biased。 Fine-tuned 4B\n    (87.51%) >> 32B zero-shot (71.69%)，gap 15.82pp： task-specific fine-tuning的value\n    massive。8x更大的零训练模型仍不如4x更小的微调模型。 Traj-level accuracy 99.1%是trivial：数据中仅1个resolved\n    instance， judge只需default to \"unresolved\"即可达99%。这highlights traj-level accuracy的\n    deceptive nature——per-test accuracy是更honest的metric。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Fine-Tuned vs Zero-Shot'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Method\n    - Per-Test Acc\n    - Fail F1\n    - Pass F1\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-4B\n      - Fine-tuned CLS\n      - 87.51\n      - 87.86\n      - 87.15\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - Zero-shot\n      - 64.4\n      - 72.2\n      - 50.5\n    - - Qwen3-32B NF4\n      - Zero-shot\n      - 71.69\n      - 75.91\n      - 65.68\n    - - Majority\n      - Baseline\n      - 51.7\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Accuracy-compute Pareto frontier: fine-tuned CLS dominates'\n  analysis: 'Uncontroversial finding。Confirms fine-tuning necessity for code verification。\n    Reviewer可能ask for few-shot or chain-of-thought baselines as additional reference。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Test Majority Voting (K=3)\n  plan_id: per-test-majority-voting\n  description: Self-consistency K=3 on per-test classification\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy_greedy: 87.51\n    accuracy_mv_k3: 86.83\n    delta_pp: -0.69\n    unanimous_rate: 93.3\n    split_samples: 127\n    flipped_correct_to_wrong: 28\n    flipped_wrong_to_correct: 15\n    net_flips: -13\n    wall_time_greedy_sec: 30\n    wall_time_mv_sec: 120\n  result_rationale: 'Majority voting hurt accuracy by 0.69pp。93.3% of predictions\n    are unanimous—— model is highly confident, disagreement occurs only on 127/1890\n    = 6.7% of samples。 These are the hardest borderline cases where model is genuinely\n    uncertain。 Voting on uncertain cases flips 28 correct→wrong vs 15 wrong→correct\n    (net -13)： the model''s first-pass greedy prediction is better than random among\n    its own alternatives。 This is unlike LLM reasoning tasks where self-consistency\n    helps——per-test classification is a discrimination task where greedy decoding\n    already captures the optimal decision boundary。 4x compute cost for worse accuracy\n    makes MV strictly dominated。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table (Appendix): Majority Voting'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Accuracy\n    - Time(s)\n    - Net Flips\n    rows:\n    - - Greedy (K=1)\n      - 87.51\n      - 30\n      - —\n    - - Majority (K=3)\n      - 86.83\n      - 120\n      - −13\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Negative result in appendix。Self-consistency不适用于well-calibrated binary\n    classifiers。\n\n    '\n- name: 5-Seed Paired Clustered Bootstrap (TOST Equivalence)\n  plan_id: 5-paired-clustered-bootstrap\n  description: Per-test vs trajectory-level TOST equivalence with clustered bootstrap\n  expected_results:\n    pooled_gap_pp: -0.45\n    pooled_ci_lower: -1.71\n    pooled_ci_upper: 0.84\n    ci_width_pp: 2.55\n    tost_p_value: 0.0071\n    tost_margin_pp: 2.0\n    equivalence_confirmed: true\n    per_seed_gaps:\n      s42: -0.97\n      s123: 1.45\n      s456: -1.84\n      s789: -0.78\n      s0: -0.29\n    seed_level_paired_t_p: 0.425\n    n_variants_pooled: 523\n    n_clusters: 114\n    n_resamples: 10000\n  result_rationale: 'TOST p=0.007 << 0.05 confirms per-test ≈ trajectory within ±2pp\n    margin。 CI [-1.71, +0.84] width = 2.55pp在median range [1.5, 3.0]——sufficiently\n    narrow to confirm equivalence but not extremely tight。 Per-seed gaps from -1.84\n    to +1.45：方向不一致，3 seeds per-test worse,  1 seed per-test better, 1 seed near-zero。This\n    inconsistency IS the equivalence signal—— if one formulation were systematically\n    better, gaps would be consistently one-sided。 ±2pp margin justification: with\n    ICC=0.191 and DEFF=3.97, 2pp is practical significance threshold given the reduced\n    effective sample size。 Clustered bootstrap (114 clusters, 10000 resamples) accounts\n    for within-problem correlation that would bias naive CI estimates。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Test vs Trajectory Equivalence'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Gap (per-test − traj, pp)\n    - Direction\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - -0.97\n      - Traj better\n    - - 123\n      - 1.45\n      - Per-test better\n    - - 456\n      - -1.84\n      - Traj better\n    - - 789\n      - -0.78\n      - Traj better\n    - - 0\n      - -0.29\n      - Traj better\n    - - Pooled\n      - −0.45 [−1.71, +0.84]\n      - TOST p=0.007\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: per-seed gaps with pooled CI, ±2pp TOST bounds as dotted verticals'\n  analysis: 'Claim 2的methodological cornerstone。TOST at p=0.007 is strong evidence。\n    Median tier下这是paper最rigorous statistical result和primary contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: CLS/CWM Error Complementarity Analysis\n  plan_id: error-overlap\n  description: CLS vs CWM error overlap on function-level (seed42, n=1890)\n  expected_results:\n    both_correct:\n      count: 1601\n      pct: 84.71\n    cls_only_correct:\n      count: 59\n      pct: 3.12\n    cwm_only_correct:\n      count: 53\n      pct: 2.8\n    both_wrong:\n      count: 177\n      pct: 9.37\n    oracle_ensemble_accuracy: 90.63\n    cls_error_mode: miss bugs (FN dominant, 75.4% of CLS errors)\n    cwm_error_mode: false alarms (FP dominant, 83.1% of CWM errors)\n    cohens_kappa_predictions: 0.88\n    cohens_kappa_correctness: 0.73\n  result_rationale: 'CLS-only correct (3.12%) ≈ CWM-only correct (2.80%)说明两种formulation有近乎equal\n    but different错误区域。Oracle ensemble 90.63%远高于either alone(87.51%)。 Error mode complementarity：CLS倾向miss\n    bugs(conservative, FN dominant)， CWM倾向false alarm(overgenerate error outputs)。这不是random\n    complementarity 而是structural：CLS的binary decision boundary和CWM的string matching\n    在不同case types上fail。 Off_by_one最complementary(CWM-only 4.8%, both wrong 14.9%)：\n    CLS难以detect subtle boundary changes but CWM sometimes captures output differences。\n    Return_value最不complementary(96.8% both correct)：both formulations handle this\n    easily。 Kappa(correctness)=0.73 < Kappa(predictions)=0.88说明agreement on what''s\n    correct is lower than agreement on predictions——there''s a meaningful disagreement\n    zone。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Error Overlap (4B, seed42)'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - '%'\n    rows:\n    - - Both correct\n      - 1601\n      - 84.71%\n    - - CLS-only correct\n      - 59\n      - 3.12%\n    - - CWM-only correct\n      - 53\n      - 2.80%\n    - - Both wrong\n      - 177\n      - 9.37%\n    - - Oracle ensemble\n      - —\n      - 90.63%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Venn diagram: CLS vs CWM error overlap'\n  - Per-mutation complementarity breakdown\n  analysis: 'Oracle ensemble 90.63%是paper的supplementary selling point。 Framing: \"formulation\n    diversity as a verification strategy\" —  even if neither CLS nor CWM individually\n    dominates, combining them yields 3.12pp lift。\n\n    '\n- name: DeepSeek Function-Level CLS (seed42)\n  plan_id: deepseek-cls-func\n  description: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CLS on function-level\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 86.8\n    pass_f1: 86.5\n    fail_f1: 87.1\n    unparseable: 0\n    vs_qwen_4b_cls_gap_pp: -0.71\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized model，parameter count略大于Qwen3-4B但\n    architecture不同(MoE-style vs dense)。在function-level CLS上达到~86.8%， 略低于Qwen 4B(87.51%)的0.71pp。差距可能来自：(1)\n    LoRA hyperparameters为Qwen优化过， DeepSeek可能需要不同rank/lr；(2) tokenizer差异影响code representation\n    quality； (3) instruction format差异(DeepSeek用自己的chat template)。 这说明CLS formulation对architecture\n    robust(差异<1pp)但不是完全invariant。 Median tier下DeepSeek CLS function-level confirms\n    CLS generalizability但无exciting finding。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Cross-architecture CLS works. Small performance gap likely attributable\n    to hyperparameter tuning.\n\n    '\n- name: DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed42)\n  plan_id: deepseek-cwm-func\n  description: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM on function-level\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 87.5\n    pass_f1: 87.3\n    fail_f1: 87.7\n    exact_match_rate: 85.1\n    unparseable: 0\n    vs_deepseek_cls_gap_pp: 0.7\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek CWM (87.5%) > DeepSeek CLS (86.8%)：gap = +0.7pp FAVORING\n    CWM。 这与Qwen finding(CLS略优)方向相反。原因推测：DeepSeek-Coder在code generation pretraining上更强，其generation\n    capability转移到execution output prediction上 比classification更efficiently。CWM在DeepSeek上exact_match\n    85.1% > Qwen的84.02%， suggesting DeepSeek生成output更precise。 This is the key median\n    tier prediction：\"mixed DeepSeek results\"—— CLS-CWM gap方向在DeepSeek上flipped，undermining\"CLS\n    universally better\"narrative。 deepseek_func_cls_cwm_gap_pp = -0.7，在[-2.0, 2.0]\n    range内。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Direction flip on DeepSeek is the defining \"mixed\" result。Paper must\n    acknowledge that CLS advantage may be architecture-specific rather than formulation-universal。\n\n    '\n- name: DeepSeek Function-Level CWM (seed123)\n  plan_id: deepseek-cwm-func-s123\n  description: Second seed for DeepSeek CWM stability check\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 86.9\n    pass_f1: 86.7\n    fail_f1: 87.1\n    exact_match_rate: 84.3\n    vs_seed42_gap_pp: -0.6\n  result_rationale: 'Seed123 CWM (86.9%) 低于 seed42 (87.5%) 0.6pp——正常seed variance\n    range。 如果DeepSeek CLS也跑seed123(假设~86.5%)，CLS-CWM gap ≈ -0.4pp(CWM slightly better)。\n    两个seeds下gap = {seed42: -0.7, seed123: ~-0.4}，方向一致(CWM better on DeepSeek) 但effect\n    size小。Cross-seed一致性比Qwen好(Qwen的CLS-CWM gap从+0.32到+2.33 across seeds)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DeepSeek Function-Level Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - DeepSeek CLS\n    - DeepSeek CWM\n    - Gap (CLS−CWM)\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - ~86.8\n      - 87.5\n      - −0.7\n    - - 123\n      - —\n      - 86.9\n      - —\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'DeepSeek CWM ≥ CLS consistently across seeds. Combined with Qwen (CLS\n    > CWM), the cross-architecture story is: formulation advantage is model-dependent,\n    not universal.\n\n    '\n- name: DeepSeek Repo-Level CLS\n  plan_id: deepseek-cls-repo\n  description: DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B fine-tuned CLS on repo-level SWE-bench data\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 80.5\n    f1_macro: 71.8\n    fail_f1: 61.2\n    pass_f1: 82.4\n    unparseable_pct: 2.1\n    majority_baseline: 73.0\n    gap_vs_baseline_pp: 7.5\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek repo-level CLS (80.5%) 在Qwen 4B(82.35%) 和 8B(84.79%)之间，\n    符合其~6.7B parameter count。Fail_f1 61.2%在median range [60,72]。 Unparseable 2.1%略高于Qwen(0-1.3%)——DeepSeek\n    tokenizer对repo-level formatting edge cases处理稍差。Gap vs majority baseline (7.5pp)说明model\n    learned meaningful signal 但比Qwen的9-12pp gap小，可能因为hyperparameter没有充分tune for repo-level。\n    Median tier意义：partial confirmation that CLS works on repo-level across architectures，\n    但performance水平无new insight(comparable to Qwen within normal variance)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Architecture Repo-Level CLS'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Accuracy\n    - Fail F1\n    - Unparseable%\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-4B (best seed)\n      - 82.35\n      - 60.87\n      - 1.3\n    - - Qwen3-8B (best seed)\n      - 84.79\n      - 72.93\n      - 0\n    - - DeepSeek-6.7B\n      - ~80.5\n      - ~61.2\n      - ~2.1\n  figures_description:\n  - Cross-architecture repo-level CLS accuracy comparison\n  analysis: 'Confirms CLS repo-level viability across architectures but adds no dramatic\n    new evidence。 In paper: single line in results table, brief mention in text。\n\n    '\n- name: Repo-Level CLS Mutation-Type Analysis\n  plan_id: repo-mutation-analysis\n  description: Per-mutation-type accuracy breakdown for repo-level CLS 8B\n  expected_results:\n    overall_accuracy: 84.48\n    gold_accuracy: 96.24\n    operator_swap: 81.38\n    off_by_one: 86.89\n    return_value: 75.44\n    boundary_removal: 46.9\n    seed123_overall: 85.6\n    seed123_boundary_removal: 44.9\n    seed123_gold: 99.6\n  result_rationale: 'Boundary_removal极低(46.9%)——接近random guessing。这类mutation移除了if/while条件判断，\n    导致代码行为大幅改变但模型难以仅从code+test text判断影响。 Return_value也低(75.4%)：返回值变化在repo-level context中更难捕获因为\n    函数调用链更长，影响propagation更complex。 Gold accuracy高(96-99%)说明模型对未mutated code的判断reliable。\n    Off_by_one在repo-level(86.9%)比function-level(82.56%)还高——可能因为 repo-level tests更explicitly\n    test boundary conditions。 Median tier下此breakdown explains为什么repo-level fail_f1\n    only 60-73%： boundary_removal(占test set 10.7%)严重拖低整体fail detection。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Repo-Level CLS 8B Mutation Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Mutation Type\n    - Accuracy (s42)\n    - Accuracy (s123)\n    rows:\n    - - Gold (no mutation)\n      - 96.24%\n      - 99.60%\n    - - operator_swap\n      - 81.38%\n      - 82.60%\n    - - off_by_one\n      - 86.89%\n      - 79.20%\n    - - return_value\n      - 75.44%\n      - 66.40%\n    - - boundary_removal\n      - 46.90%\n      - 44.90%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Radar chart: mutation-type accuracy across models (func 4B, repo 4B, repo 8B)'\n  analysis: Boundary_removal is the Achilles heel. Represents instances where CLS\n    cannot determine test outcome from static code analysis alone — would need execution-like\n    reasoning。 This partially validates CWM's approach (predicting execution) for\n    specific mutation types。\n","numLines":1234,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1234}}}
